# Delivery loop

The versioned master source is `conduct/methodology/SKILL.md`; installs expose it as `.agents/skills/delivery-loop/SKILL.md`. Code conduct is sourced from `conduct/conduct/SKILL.md` and installed as `.agents/skills/delivery-loop-conduct/SKILL.md`. Cursor and Claude skill entries link to those canonical directories.

Follow the pinned v2 methodology and the client's own overlay. The client owns eligibility, product acceptance meaning, Jira settings, and deployment/environment instructions. The engine is the only status writer. `audit` is read-only. `deliver` and intake `sweep` are explicit commands, not scheduled triggers. `ship`, `ship continue`, and `ship sweep` check approval before promote or continue. `ship sweep` is the hourly schedule and the `ship-continue` repository dispatch.

For v1 pack or run-state migration, follow `.agents/skills/delivery-loop/MIGRATION-V1-TO-V2.md`. Never add a v1 parser or skill alias.
